<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's prelim Apr PPI up 1.3 pct m/m -stat.</title>
<headline>Hungary's prelim Apr PPI up 1.3 pct m/m -stat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's producer price index (PPI) rose 1.3 percent in April according to preliminary figures compared with a 1.5 percent increase in March, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise in April was 20.0 percent, compared to 21.8 percent in March.</p>
<p>HUNGARY PRODUCER PRICE INDEX (pct change)</p>
<p>				  April 1997    March 1997   April 1996</p>
<p>    month-on-month	    +1.3	    +1.5	    +2.9</p>
<p>    year-on-year	     +20.0	   +22.2	   +22.5</p>
<p>NOTE - The April 1997 figures are preliminary. The KSH said it would publish final figures on June 11.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
